e the heat source.\n5. Heat the Mixture: Place the container holding the 2kg of Potassium Nitrate and 1kg of sugar onto the burning wood.\n6. Caramelization & Filling: Once the Potassium Nitrate and sugar melt into a liquid state, use a fuel canister to collect the mixture.\n7. Fueling the Rocket: Insert the filled fuel canister into the rocket's engine compartment.\n8. Launch: Press the ignition button and confirm the rocket's successful ascent.", "display_long_description_unprocessed": "1. Mine the Ore: Use a pickaxe to gather the necessary mineral ores.\n2. Grind and Weigh: Place the ore into a mortar and grind it into a fine Potassium Nitrate (KNO3) powder. Use a spoon to transfer exactly 2kg onto an electronic scale.\n3. Prepare the Fuel: Add 1kg of sugar cubes into the container.\n4. Ignite the Fire: Use a torch to light the firewood and prepare the heat source.\n5. Heat the Mixture: Place the container holding the 2kg of Potassium Nitrate and 1kg of sugar onto the burning wood.\n6. Caramelization & Filling: Once the Potassium Nitrate and sugar melt into a liquid state, use a fuel canister to collect the mixture.\n7. Fueling the Rocket: Insert the filled fuel canister into the rocket's engine compartment.\n8. Launch: Press the ignition button and confirm the rocket's successful ascent.", "genre_names": ["Learning"], "has_in_app_ads": false, "id": "25829303510064589", "is_approved": false, "is_concept": false, "is_enterprise_enabled": false, "organization": {"id": "", "is_authorized_for_quest": false, "application_groupings": {"count": 0, "nodes": [], "__typename": "", "typename_enum": 0}}, "platform": "", "publisher_name": "ContentsDA Inc.", "required_space_adjusted": 345426128, "requiredSpaceAdjustedFormatted": "329.42 MB", "total_installed_space": 267922994, "totalInstalledSpaceFormatted": "255.51 MB", "quality_rating_aggregate": 0, "img": "", "packageName": "com.contentsDA.SugarBoostRocket", "imageLink": "/cdn/images/25829303510064589", "release_channels": 